性ですがThe・腐れ縁って感じです。仲良い故に悪態つつきあえる関係です。距離感は近すぎず、遠すぎずって感じでお願いします。\n\nこの2人で夏っぽいイラストを描いて欲しいです！夏っぽければなんでもいいです(水着以外で)。ポーズや構図は完全にお任せします！イラストのサイズですがipadの壁紙にしたら丁度よさそうな感じが嬉しいですが、そこは無理にサイズを合わせなくても全然大丈夫です。\n\n以上です。学校での課題などで忙しいと思いますのでその場合は依頼を断って頂いても構いません。お願いいたします。", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1209903, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "さえき", "screen_name": "hill_yoll", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1908163147724423168/H6aqMp6u.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1205813486128730112/1718105560/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 50, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "video"}], "nc": 49}, {"id": 1337647, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "スイ🐰", "screen_name": "suimizG", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1609070287097847808/s-Xb3axG.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/235435478/1669351776/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 0}, {"id": 1375239, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "古宮よる/komiya yoru", "screen_name": "yoru_tsuki12", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1922925899974049792/B6GbTAGL.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1368572539023224832/1706795314/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_accep